// ---- game/shaders/undertow/undertow_body_march.gdshaderinc ----
// Hymn of the Undertow: the Undertow body's raymarch (M1-RND-03), as a function of one view ray, shared by
// the spatial body (undertow_body.gdshaderinc) and the compute body (undertow_body_compute.glsl, M2-RND-01).
// Docs: docs/kb/tech/undertow.md. The includer declares the uniforms first: the spatial body through
// undertow_body_uniforms.gdshaderinc and globals.gdshaderinc, the compute body in its UBO (with
// UNDERTOW_COMPUTE defined), plus noise_tex either way. The variant defines are listed in
// undertow_body.gdshaderinc.

#ifndef HYMN_UNDERTOW_BODY_MARCH_GDSHADERINC
#define HYMN_UNDERTOW_BODY_MARCH_GDSHADERINC

// ---- game/shaders/undertow/undertow_lattice.gdshaderinc ----
// Hymn of the Undertow: the baked noise lattice (M1-RND-10), shared by the raymarched body
// (undertow_body_march.gdshaderinc, spatial and compute) and, since M2-RND-08, the Low-tier shells. One
// trilinear fetch of assets/vfx/undertow/undertow_noise3d.png at a quintic-remapped coordinate replaces the
// eight PCG3D hashes of a hymn_value_noise3. The includer declares `noise_tex` (3D, linear, repeat) and
// `noise_texels` first, and includes this before undertow_common.gdshaderinc, so the striation warp fetches
// the lattice too (UNDERTOW_BAKED_NOISE).

